What `verify_sub`'s child proof reader takes from `open_stacked`'s template (`B1/Whir/Template.lean`
at the configurations `osCfg m` of the `LIG_*` tables), precomputed and checked equal to it by
kernel evaluation (`Fast/WhirTablesCheck.lean`): each candidate's stream words, and its levels'
`opening_queries` calls (`osQCalls`), each as an `OsCall` of numbers.
-/

